hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16840","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Nasr ibn Ali narrated to me, he said: Yusuf ibn Khalid narrated to us, he said: Abu Ja'far al-Khatmi narrated to us from Abd al-Rahman ibn Uqba ibn al-Fakih from his grandfather al-Fakih ibn Sa'd, and he was a companion, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) used to bathe on Friday and on the day of Arafa and on the day of Fitr and on the day of sacrifice. He said: And al-Fakih ibn Sa'd used to order his family to bathe on these days."
